				"description": "{H7 Memorial Blacksmith}\n\nA blacksmith in memory of H7. It is guarded by a great army of level 1-7 creatures from one H7 faction, along with that faction's level 5 Warfare Units. After defeating the guards, a hero with at least Basic Artillery, Engineering or First Aid can claim the marker for the matching slot here: from then on, at the start of combat, the hero's original war machines are replaced by H7 Warfare Units of this faction (Artillery: Ballista and Ammo Cart slots; Engineering: Catapult slot; First Aid: First Aid Tent slot).\nLevel: 2 with Basic, 3 with Advanced, 4 with Expert in the matching skill; 5 with Artillery, Engineering and First Aid all together (the Undead King's Reaper Arts counts as having all three). Come back to claim more after learning a new skill.",
				"visitMode": "unlimited",
				"selectMode": "selectAll",
